---
import ProseLayout from "../layouts/ProseLayout.astro";
import { app, contactEmail, legalName, play } from "../config";
import { hasAccounts as A, hasAiRelease as H, legalDate } from "../lib/release";
---

<ProseLayout
  title="Terms of use"
  description={`The terms for using the ${app.name} app and this website.`}
  updated={legalDate}
>
  <p>
    These terms cover the {app.name} app and this website, provided by{" "}
    {legalName}. By installing or using {app.name}, you agree to them. Please
    also read the
    <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Using {app.name}</h2>
  <p>
    {app.name} is free{H && ", with an optional paid subscription"}. You may use
    it to make videos for any lawful purpose, personal or commercial. Exports
    carry no watermark.
  </p>
  <p>
    Some built-in fonts and stickers are made by others and come with their own
    open licences, listed in <strong>Settings → Open-source licences</strong>.
    The Animated sticker pack (Animated Noto Emoji by Google, CC BY 4.0) asks
    you to credit it when you share a video that uses it.
  </p>

  <h2>Your content</h2>
  <p>
    Your videos, photos, recordings and projects are yours. {app.name} doesn't
    claim any rights to them.{" "}
    {A
      ? "They're kept in your account only to sync them to your phones (see the "
      : "They stay on your phone (see the "}
    <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>
    {A ? ")." : H ? " for the exceptions, cloud AI and template links)." : " for the one exception, cloud AI)."}
    You're responsible for having the right to use what you edit and share.
  </p>

  <h2>Cloud AI features</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Cloud AI is optional. {app.name} asks before every upload, and you can
      switch it off in
      <strong>Settings → Cloud AI</strong>.
    </li>
    <li>
      Each phone gets free cloud AI {H ? "minutes and AI edit requests" : "minutes"}{" "}
      every month. How many, and which features use them, may change. The
      service can also pause, for example when the month's budget is used up.
    </li>
    <li>
      Only send {H ? "sound and words" : "sound"} you have the right to send,
      and don't use cloud AI for anything unlawful.
    </li>
    {
      H && (
        <li>
          AI edit and translation can be wrong. {app.name} shows every change
          before it's kept; check them, and the words of translated captions,
          before you publish. Don't use them to make content that is unlawful,
          deceptive or harmful, or that breaks the{" "}
          <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/legal/aup">usage policy</a> of
          Anthropic, which provides the AI.
        </li>
      )
    }
    <li>
      Don't try to get around the limits, copy or reverse-engineer {app.name}'s
      server, or use it outside the app.
    </li>
  </ul>

  {
    H && (
      <>
        <h2>Template links</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            A template you share as a link can be opened by anyone who has the
            link, in {app.name} or on this website. Share only templates whose
            texts you're happy for others to see and reuse.
          </li>
          <li>
            We may remove a shared template that breaks the law or these terms.
            You can remove yours with{" "}
            <strong>Settings → Cloud AI → Delete my cloud data</strong>.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </>
    )
  }

  <h2>Getting {app.name} and updates</h2>
  <p>
    Get {app.name} only from{" "}
    {play.live ? "Google Play or " : ""}
    <a href="/download">this website</a>, which links to the official
    {play.live ? " listing and file" : " file"}. Copies from anywhere else may be changed or unsafe.
    New versions install over the old one and keep your projects.
  </p>

  <h2>Paid features</h2>
  {
    H ? (
      <ul>
        <li>
          {app.name} Pro is an optional subscription that adds more cloud AI and
          some time-saving tools. Every editing tool on the phone stays free.
        </li>
        <li>
          Pro is sold through Google Play only, under Google Play's terms: the
          price, any free trial and the renewal period are shown before you pay.
          It renews automatically until you cancel in Google Play; cancelling
          keeps Pro until the end of the period you paid for. Refunds follow
          Google Play's refund policies.
        </li>
        <li>
          What Pro includes, and its monthly cloud AI limits, may change. The
          current list is on {app.name}'s Pro screen in the app.
        </li>
      </ul>
    ) : (
      <p>
        {app.name} is free today. If paid features come later, their price and
        terms will be shown before you pay, and these terms will be updated.
      </p>
    )
  }

  <h2>No warranty</h2>
  <p>
    {app.name} is provided as it is, without warranties of any kind. We work to
    make it reliable, but we can't promise it will be free of bugs or always
    available. Keep copies of media that matter to you.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    As far as the law allows, {legalName} isn't liable for indirect or
    consequential losses, or for lost data, arising from your use of {app.name}{" "}
    or this website. Nothing in these terms limits rights you have by law that
    can't be limited.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    If these terms change, the new version will be posted on this page with a
    new date. If you keep using {app.name} after that, the new terms apply.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about these terms:{" "}
    <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>.
  </p>
</ProseLayout>
